Project: Riot game simulator 
Testers: Castillo-Weigert Javier Ákos
Version Tested: Web Build v1.0
Environment:
Browser: Chrome 121, Firefox 123
OS: Windows 10 / Linux Mint
Server: XAMPP local MySQL + PHP backend

1. Test Summary
The aim of testing was to verify:
Core gameplay functionality
Web deployment performance
UI flows (menu ? game ? death screen)

Overall stability: Good, but some minor UI and collision issues found.

2. Test Items
Tested components:
Game Features
Player movement & animations
Enemy AI 
Player damage & death
Website & Interface
Main menu (Start, Settings, Login)
Keybinding settings
Death screen & score display
fullscreen function 
gameplay display

3. Test Scope
Included:
Gameplay interactions
UI/UX behavior
Browser performance
Database communication
Responsiveness and rendering
Excluded:
Mobile testing (not part of project)
Cross-browser edge cases (Safari)
Extreme server load

