Optimization required

6. Recommendations
Add boundary checks using clamp() in Godot to prevent wall clipping
Preload UI scenes to fix delayed death screen
Add server-side sorting for leaderboard
Reduce unnecessary draw calls or enemy update frequency

7. Conclusion
The game is functional and stable for a version 1.0 release.
Primary gameplay works smoothly, and no critical errors prevent users from playing or saving scores.
Several performance and UX issues remain, but they do not block gameplay.


